## Skip Signal Taxonomy

| Playtime | Signal | Action |
|----------|--------|--------|
| < 15% | Acoustic mismatch — wrong neighbourhood | Attribute per dimension, adjust territory centroid |
| 15–70% | Moderate engagement | Log, no immediate action |
| > 70% | Transition signal — track was right, arc can move | **NOT rejection** — proceed to next step |

**The > 70% skip is a psychology law (PSYCHOLOGY.md LAW_7).** Never treat it as negative signal. The track served its purpose.

