## Intent → CLAP Target Pipeline

```
User intent text
    ↓
[parallel]
    A. CLAP text embed  → 512D navigation target
    B. LLM PersonaLens  → Spotify search seeds (artist names, genres)
    ↓
PersonaLens seeds → Spotify search → track pool (100–200 tracks)
Track pool → batch CLAP audio embed → 512D per track
    ↓
arc/generate: beam search from current_position → target embedding
```

**PersonaLens is search-only.** It generates Spotify API query strings. It does not produce acoustic targets. The acoustic target is always the CLAP text embedding of the intent.

**Arc shape inference** from intent text — check `lib/arcShape.ts`:
- DISCHARGE_SIGNALS: process, feel it, meet me where i am, sad, grief, cry, heavy, loss
- PLATEAU_SIGNALS: study, focus, work, deep work, flow, concentrate, locked in
- PEAK_EARLY_SIGNALS: workout, run, lift, training, hype, pregame, sprint

