## Psychology Laws — Engine Must Enforce

**Match before you move:** Arc starts acoustically close to current state (cosine_distance < 0.15 from user's last track). Never start at the destination.

**Earn the peaks:** Frisson candidates only at 30–40%, 65–70%, 85–90% of arc. Requires ≥3 lower-energy tracks before each spike.

**Novelty is earned:** First 20–30% of session anchors in familiar acoustic territory (measured by distance from territory centroid). Discovery only on explicit request.

**Metabolic floor:** Never drop energy + density to zero. Minimum floor prevents session death.

**90-minute default:** One BRAC cycle. Plateau arcs: density dip at ~80 min then recovery. Peak-early arcs: apex at 40%, BRAC descent after 60 min.

**Soft Pause = third state:** Not binary play/stop. Acoustic resolution → hold → re-entry protocol.

**Context informs direction, not selection:** Activity signals (run, study, drive) shift the acoustic direction vector only. Track selection governed by CLAP distance + behavioral history.

