## Acoustic Reference Profiles (5D display coordinates — not navigation targets)

| Goal | Energy | Warmth | Density | Organicity | Sacred | Arc Shape |
|------|--------|--------|---------|-----------|--------|-----------|
| Deep focus | 0.35 | 0.55 | 0.25 | 0.65 | 0.45 | Plateau |
| Zone 2 run | 0.45 | 0.55 | 0.40 | 0.50 | 0.20 | Plateau |
| High intensity | 0.85 | 0.50 | 0.75 | 0.35 | 0.40 | Peak Early |
| Wind down | 0.20 | 0.75 | 0.20 | 0.70 | 0.70 | Discharge |
| Lock-in | 0.20→0.45 | 0.40 | 0.20→0.35 | 0.65 | 0.45 | Plateau |
| Processing | 0.25 | 0.60 | 0.20 | 0.65 | 0.55 | Discharge |

These feed the intent system as approximate reference points. The arc navigates in CLAP space toward the text embedding, not toward these coordinates.

